cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use agent-team in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "agent-team"
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code plugin that seats a team of AI roles in any project. It scans
  the repository, offers lean, recommended and full teams from a catalogue of
  29 seat rulebooks, merged seats and derived roles, and re-evaluates the team
  as the work changes, asking the owner only what only the owner can decide.
